  "description": "(3.0.1) Vision-pack contract surface for CircleAI. IComputerVisionRuntime + IFaceDetector + IFaceEmbedder + IFaceLivenessDetector + IDocumentVerifier + IPlateRecognizer + IBluetoothAnomalyDetector. Null implementations ship out of the box; real backends — compv (CV foundation), facex (face stack), FaceLivenessDetection-SDK, KYC-Documents-Verif-SDK, ultimateALPR-SDK, Bluehound — land in 2.2.1 when the C++ SDKs are vendored under native/<sdk>/. Letting integrators (PhonePin biometric auth, Sdpkt wallet KYC, TagMe / Panik vehicle features, AetherNet adversary detection) build against the surface today.",
